  "historyNote": "#7713, eff 6-21-02; ss by #9728, eff 6-18-10; ss by #12559, INTERIM, eff 6-26-18, EXPIRED: 12-24-18 New. #12700, eff 12-28-18 (formerly He-M 523.04)",
